<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Delete</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>delete self forever
say delete me
</pre>
<p>Deletes your character, forever: it can't be undone, and the gods can't 
bring it back. First type delete self forever. The game tells you what 
deleting means and asks you to be sure; if you are, type say delete me. 
Typing anything else instead aborts the deletion. If you are in a clan, 
you leave it first.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Quit</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cdefect</a>
</pre>




</div>